              "text" : "<font face=\"Tahoma\">Dear {!$Expression.First_Name} {!$Expression.Last_Name},<br /><br />Thank you again for your interest in Zeta Elementary School. Choosing an elementary school means thinking about where your child will spend their days, learn to read and write, make friends, discover what they love, and build the foundation for everything that comes next.<br /><br />As you consider your options, we encourage you to ask a few essential questions.</font><br /><br />"
