              "text" : "<font face=\"Tahoma\">Children are naturally curious. Zeta gives that curiosity somewhere to go. In Z Lab and across their classes, students investigate problems, design solutions, build, test, and try again. They learn that they can use what they know to create something of their own. All while having fun!</font><br /><br />"
